player_prompt.intro:
Kai ne Player {player_id} a wasan 3-player Iterated Prisoner's Dilemma. Wasan yaƙi {num_rounds} zagaye.
Ginin zagaye:
• {conv_rounds} zagayen free-chat
• 1 zagaye na shawara - gabatar da kawai token ɗaya ga kowane abokin hamayya: '[<opp-id> cooperate]' ko '[<opp-id> defect]' (ma'ana '[1 defect] [2 cooperate]'; na asali shine 'hadin kai'). 
Tebar pay-off matrix (an watsa shi ga kowane yare na unordered):
  - Duk sun hada kai  ->  {reward}
  - Duk sun kasa     ->  {punishment}
  - Kai ka kasa, sun hada kai -> {temptation}
  - Kai ka hada kai, sun kasa -> {sucker}
Dan wasan (dan wasa) da mafiya alamar a ƙarshen dukkan zagaye ya lashe.
